# This directory is reserved for implementation-specific prompt templates.
#
# The default implementation reuses the shared prompt templates from
# the workflow root prompts/ directory:
# - prompts/extract_keypoints.txt
# - prompts/remove_redundancy.txt
# - prompts/preserve_meaning.txt
#
# To add implementation-specific prompts, place them here and update
# the component mapping in default.impl.md to reference them with the
# "default:" prefix instead of "shared:".
